      "id": 73680,
      "name": "phantaskippy",
      "username": "phantaskippy",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-09-18T15:37:59.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I believe you could not destroy cards under another card for Singularity or Self-Sabotage, because cards under other cards lose their text, and are only counted as cards, not Equipment or Components.</p><p>That's why F6 Tempest works, it only has to be one of your cards, it doesn't have to have text.</p>",
